<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa H1 passenger numbers up 5.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa H1 passenger numbers up 5.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>German airline Deutsche Lufthansa AG said on Tuesday that passenger numbers in the first half of 1997 rose 5.7 percent to 20.8 million from 19.682 million in the same period last year.</p>
<p>Lufthansa said that passenger load factor in the first half was 71.7 percent versus 67.6 percent last time.</p>
</text>
